  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## What happened on 2026-10-24/25\nCore lacked the memory to load one tenant, so that tenant could read nothing from about 13:00Z. Core was resized by hand at 21:51Z to make room; the resize restarted it, and on that restart a write-ahead-log ordering defect made Core refuse every egress reservation. **Every read through the control plane failed for 12 hours 7 minutes**, until a fixed Core build started at 10:05Z on the 25th. **No alert fired.**\n\nEvery number here recomputes for the time window (top right). Red markers are events, orange are Core restarts, purple are control-plane restarts; hover one for its text. Use **Last 7 days** for the bandwidth history."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Answered (by volume)",
      "description": "Control-plane responses that were 2xx or 304, as a share of all its responses in the window. Busy hours outweigh quiet ones, so an outage that also cuts traffic barely moves it: read 'Hours with most reads failing' beside it.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus_on_fly"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase(fly_edge_http_responses_count{app=\"allsource-control-plane\", status=~\"2..|304\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(fly_edge_http_responses_count{app=\"allsource-control-plane\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Hours mostly failing",
      "description": "15-minute buckets where under half of control-plane responses were answered, added up in hours. The outage alone is 12.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus_on_fly"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "(count_over_time(((sum(increase(fly_edge_http_responses_count{app=\"allsource-control-plane\", status=~\"2..|304\"}[15m])) / sum(increase(fly_edge_http_responses_count{app=\"allsource-control-plane\"}[15m]))) < 0.5)[$__range:15m]) * 0.25) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
